{"4840700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Boo Club", "steam_appid": 4840700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4860190], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE BOO CLUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a member of the Boo Club,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a gathering of amateur paranormal investigators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The problem is, these guys are morons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/356f138d6551b0fbf285a35692980f2c.avif?t=1787812390\" width=236 height=479 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LEADER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >El Professor, permanently drunk, and making horrible, stupid plans. Welcome recruit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/bba0bdfe2c74face3e5c5dbd597f3f08.avif?t=1787812390\" width=312 height=398 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone or with friends, explore a spooky mansion filled with monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/5f35bab1ce4b9d9a3afa5cac80a5df2d.poster.avif?t=1787812390\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/5f35bab1ce4b9d9a3afa5cac80a5df2d.webm?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/5f35bab1ce4b9d9a3afa5cac80a5df2d.mp4?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>USE CRAZY ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an array of crazy items, against the monsters, or your friends ;-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/06fee21168f36a898038665f38df759f.poster.avif?t=1787812390\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/06fee21168f36a898038665f38df759f.webm?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/06fee21168f36a898038665f38df759f.mp4?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE RITUAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate the items and start the ritual, but make sure you are prepared for the final horde attack. It pays to collaborate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/deb09f6021d401f17a2270ca9c012eb1.poster.avif?t=1787812390\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/deb09f6021d401f17a2270ca9c012eb1.webm?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/deb09f6021d401f17a2270ca9c012eb1.mp4?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player and Online co-op for 1–4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunted mansion and its grounds, and learn the level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized equipment and locations each time, each session plays different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique items that create both helpful and chaotic situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive fallen teammates and work together to explore and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable 15–30 minute sessions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE BOO CLUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a member of the Boo Club,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a gathering of amateur paranormal investigators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The problem is, these guys are morons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/356f138d6551b0fbf285a35692980f2c.avif?t=1787812390\" width=236 height=479 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LEADER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >El Professor, permanently drunk, and making horrible, stupid plans. Welcome recruit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/bba0bdfe2c74face3e5c5dbd597f3f08.avif?t=1787812390\" width=312 height=398 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone or with friends, explore a spooky mansion filled with monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/5f35bab1ce4b9d9a3afa5cac80a5df2d.poster.avif?t=1787812390\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/5f35bab1ce4b9d9a3afa5cac80a5df2d.webm?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/5f35bab1ce4b9d9a3afa5cac80a5df2d.mp4?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>USE CRAZY ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an array of crazy items, against the monsters, or your friends ;-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/06fee21168f36a898038665f38df759f.poster.avif?t=1787812390\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/06fee21168f36a898038665f38df759f.webm?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/06fee21168f36a898038665f38df759f.mp4?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE RITUAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate the items and start the ritual, but make sure you are prepared for the final horde attack. It pays to collaborate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/deb09f6021d401f17a2270ca9c012eb1.poster.avif?t=1787812390\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/deb09f6021d401f17a2270ca9c012eb1.webm?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/extras/deb09f6021d401f17a2270ca9c012eb1.mp4?t=1787812390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player and Online co-op for 1–4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunted mansion and its grounds, and learn the level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized equipment and locations each time, each session plays different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique items that create both helpful and chaotic situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive fallen teammates and work together to explore and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable 15–30 minute sessions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The Boo Club is a co-op haunted-house adventure for 1–4 players. Explore a haunted mansion, locate the ritual altar, and complete a dangerous ritual, under the attack of the monster horde!  Use teamwork, quick thinking, and a lot of crazy items, and exorcise the mansion!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/2d98aefd3104ce96dbc49439d39715938503d2df/header.jpg?t=1787812390", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/7fe07c105cb557c483dcf2e78b6d520d629c5379/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787812390", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840700/7fe07c105cb557c483dcf2e78b6d520d629c5379/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787812390", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Ver